WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.105
Hi! It's Saturday, and I'm not sure about my plans!

2
00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:09.713
Look at the sky. It might rain later.

3
00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:15.817
If it doesn't rain, we might go hiking in the mountains.

4
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:22.200
Or we might have a picnic in the park. I'm not sure!

5
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.026
Oh! And today is my sister's birthday.

6
00:00:28.476 --> 00:00:32.795
Happy birthday, Ana! May all your dreams come true!

7
00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:37.924
And you? What might you do this weekend?

